<title>DENMARK: Novo applied to sell oral diabetes drug.</title>
<headline>Novo applied to sell oral diabetes drug.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish drug group Novo Nordisk said on Tuesday that it had applied to United States and European authorities for clearance to market its new oral diabetes treatment, NovoNorm.</p>
<p>&quot;NovoNorm has been sent for registration in both the United States and Europe,&quot; Novo director Lars Rebien Soerensen told Reuters.</p>
</text>
